// The C expression a `then (import NAME).a.b` clause reads, before an index or
// a length is taken from it (check/entry.id): the export read the way checked_read
// reads it, then one list cell, unboxed to its field's type, for each field of
// the path. A struct is a list at run time, one cell per field in declaration
// order, so a field is its position. Filed here because the check/ lane is at
// the three-function limit.
then_imp_get(int node) {
  string rd = checked_read((import ns1)[node]);
  string[] steps = string_split((import ns2)[node], ".");
